# The import hub for the whole raw tree: raw.satellite imports raw.launch,
# which pulls in vehicle -> stage -> engine plus platform, sites, organization
# and etl.
#
# Not what refreshes the tree. A file refresh builds only what the file itself
# declares, and this one declares nothing, so `trilogy refresh refresh.preql`
# probes everything and builds nothing (`--include-imports` builds it all).
# The space-refresh cloud job is a directory refresh of data/ instead, the
# same as `trilogy refresh data` locally. [dependencies] in trilogy.toml still
# names the refresh by this path.
import raw.satellite;
